  "articleBody": "A second-story addition can create substantial living space without expanding the home’s footprint, but it requires an early review of structure, zoning, plans, utilities, and construction access. In San Diego County, the right design-build partner should connect feasibility, architectural design, engineering, permit documents, and construction planning before work begins.",
